formation, such as street and email addresses, telephone and fax numbers, and Web page URLs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="38453">contact</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="439422">kontaktu</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11748_136786_440050"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A display setting that holds up to 256 specific color entries. Any color palette attached to a picture is by definition an 8-bit palette.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="136786">8-bit color</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="440050">8 biteko kolore</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11757_146879_440142"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The device that communicates between your software program and your printer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="146879">printer driver</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="440142">inprimagailu-kontrolatzaile</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11758_153847_440188"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An object created with one program and embedded into a document created by another. Embedding the object, rather than simply inserting or pasting it, ensures that the object retains its original format. If you double-click the embedded object, you can edit it with the toolbars and menus from the program used to create it.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="153847">embedded object</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="440188">kapsulatutako objektu</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11759_307436_320677"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The mechanism used to help a caller differentiate between users with names that match the touch-tone or speech input.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="307436">Matched Name Selection Method</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="320677">Bat datozen Izenak Hautatzeko Metodo</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11765_2795839_3180046"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Microsoft's antimalware solution that provides next generation protection f