 feature that enables applications to use external library assemblies retrieved from the server or from the local browser cache.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1119094">application library caching</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1359229">aplikazio-liburutegia cachean gordetze</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24259_1119096_1359227"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Silverlight, classes that extend the application model by providing services that can participate in the application life cycle.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1119096">application extension services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1359227">aplikazioa hedatzeko zerbitzuak</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24260_1119097_1359290"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Silverlight, a feature that enables communication between two Silverlight-based applications running on the same computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1119097">local messaging</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1359290">mezularitza