ers of a group. Members all contribute to a group profile, and can post blog entries, photos, and other items, just as they can to an individual profile.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1136239">Windows Live Groups</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1147261">Windows Live Taldeak</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24602_1136240_1147260"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The website where developers and hobbyists can upload their custom creations designed to work with Windows Live or Windows Vista. Visitors to the gallery can download the software, write reviews, and post messages to online forums.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1136240">Windows Live Gallery</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1147260">Windows Live Gallery</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24603_1136241_1147256"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The set of Microsoft software for email, instant messaging, photos, and personal movies available to customers in a single download and installation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1136241">Windows Live Essentials</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1147256">Windows Live Essentials</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24603_1136241_1676143"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The set of Microsoft software for email, instant messaging, photos, and personal movies available to customers in a single download and installation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1136241">Windows Live Essentials</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1676143">Windows Essentials</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24603_1636168_1147256"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The set of Microsoft software for email, instant messaging, photos, and personal movies available to customers in a single download and installation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1636168">Windows Essentials</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1147256">Windows Live Essentials</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></ter