on that displays alerts and notifications.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2009037">desktop app bar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2014390">mahaigaineko aplikazio-barra</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="34735_2009421_2014398"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The workspace along the bottom edge of the screen that enables the user to access Office 365 services or sign out.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2009421">mobile app bar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2014398">mugikorreko aplikazio-barra</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="34739_2012681_2014400"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that enables users to compose or reply to a message without leaving the context of the conversation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2012681">Quick Compose</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2014400">Idazketa bizkor</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="34741_2012702_2522094"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows organizations to comply with legal discovery requirements by searching and holding relevant content from mailboxes, Skype for Business, and SharePoint Online websites, documents and file shares.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2012702">In-Place eDiscovery</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2522094">Datu elektronikoen hautemate lokala</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="34748_2012910_2014408"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office feature that creates a view where users can see the content that has been shared with them.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2012910">Shared with Me</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2014408">Nirekin partekatutakoak</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="34749_2012913_2014396"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows a preview of a webpage or YouTube video. The preview will show a photo, title, and description of the webpage or video.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2012913">Inline Previews</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2014396">txertatutako aurrebista</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="34750_2012915_2014389"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A button that opens the current document’s table of contents in a pane. Users can pin the pane to the document, and when they scroll through the document, the table of contents dynamically highlights the section they are in.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2012915">Contents</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2014389">Edukia</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="34751_2012916_2014393"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The UI element that enables the user to locate text and go to locations where the text occurs in a document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2012916">Find</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2014393">Bilatu</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNo