 feature that allows users to choose between different Layouts for the selected content.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2139466">Layout Gallery</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2152993">Diseinuen galeria</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3754_240555_2736584"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The web page that serves as a starting point for exploring Business Contact Manager for Outlook.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="240555">Business Contact Manager Home Page</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2736584">Business Contact Manager-en hasierako orri</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37566_2144218_2926521"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A non-production instance of CRM Online intended for the sole purpose of previewing future releases of CRM Online.  (Betas, etc…)</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2144218">preview instance</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2926521">aurreargitalpen-instantzia</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><te