 to send ad requests to multiple ad networks to ensure that publishers can match the right ad networks to the right inventory and maximize the ad revenue.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2157433">ad mediation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2180580">iragarki-bitartekotza</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37787_2158519_2224646"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An ID that is given to an app developer by a software system supporting custom apps when the developer registers their app with the software system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2158519">client ID</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2224646">bezeroaren ID</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37788_2158520_2224658"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A solicitation of ideas or content from a large group of people, generally from an online community.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2158520">crowdsourcing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2224658">lankidetza ireki</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type