ness and Education Store, to get apps and other digital goods into the hands of employees or students.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259632">distribute</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2261877">banatu</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38881_2259633_2261946"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A mode that allows using one app on your mobile screen while using a different app on a second screen that you're projecting from the mobile device.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259633">dual-screen mode</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2261946">pantaila bikoitzeko modua</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38882_2259634_2261887"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that lets customers extend their gaming experience across multiple devices, play with other users, and show off scores and achievements.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259634">game hub</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2261887">jokoen atala</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="par