"definition">The app that consumers can use to send feedback to the Windows team, to check for responses to that feedback, and to get news about the latest updates.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353112">Windows Feedback Hub</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353495">Iruzkinen atala</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40502_2353112_2353497"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app that consumers can use to send feedback to the Windows team, to check for responses to that feedback, and to get news about the latest updates.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353112">Windows Feedback Hub</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353497">Windows Iruzkinen atala</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40502_2353113_2353495"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app that consumers can use to send feedback to the Windows team, to check for responses to that feedback, and to get news about the latest updates.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353113">Feedback Hub</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353495">Iruzkinen atala</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40502_2353113_2353497"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app that consumers can use to send feedback to the Windows team, to check for responses to that feedback, and to get news about the latest updates.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353113">Feedback Hub</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353497">Windows Iruzkinen atala</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40503_2353114_2353493"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A group of settings that admins can use to manage files and operating system settings on enterprise-owned devices.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353114">enterprise control</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353493">enpresa-kontrol</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40504_2353123_2353496"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The modern implementation of Windows PowerShell built on .NET Core. It includes a command-line shell, scripting language, and automation engine, providing IT administrators comprehensive control and automation of system administration tasks across multiple platforms.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353123">PowerShell Core</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353496">PowerShell Core</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40505_2353124_2369117"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The record of the financial consequences of accounting events in the subledger journal.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353124">jounalization</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2369117">kutxako liburuan erregistratzea</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40507_2353363_2369116"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A knowledge article that's created within an organization and available only on the intranet for that organization.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353363">internal article</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2369116">barne-erabilerarako artikulu</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40508_2353364_2369110"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A knowledge article that's created in an organization and that's available on the Internet external to that organization.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353364">external article</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2369110">kanpo-erabilerarako artikulu</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40510_2353365_2369095"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A dashboard component that extracts actionable items from emails and displays them as cards.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353365">Action Hub</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2369095">Ekintzen atala</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40511_2353386_2353930"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The group of add-ons for Office 2016 that includes one or more of the following: proofing tools, an LIP, a language pack, and/or a spellchecker.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353386">Office 2016 Language Accessory Pack</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353930">Office 2016 Language Accessory Pack</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40512_2353387_2369126"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A solution that's installed in Microsoft Dynamics CRM that you can use to run a project, including allocating resources and checking availability, setting work hours, and booking resources.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353387">project service</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2369126">proiektu-zerbitzua</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40513_2353388_2369112"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A CRM solution that you can use to manage field service, including routing and scheduling, work process automation, customer and partner communications capabilities, and reporting and business intelligence.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353388">field service</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2369112">eremu-zerbitzua</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40514_2353944_2354604"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A methodology to query data residing in the computer’s random access memory.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353944">in-memory analytics</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2354604">analisia memorian</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40515_2353945_2354605"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A memory-optimized database engine integrated into the SQL Server engine, optimized for OLTP workloads accessing memory resident data to achieve significant improvements in performance and reduction in processing time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353945">in-memory OLTP</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2354605">OLTP memorian</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40515_2599244_2354605"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A memory-optimized database engine integrated into the SQL Server engine, optimized for OLTP workloads accessing memory resident data to achieve significant improvements in performance and reduction in processing time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2599244">XTP</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2354605">OLTP memorian</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40515_2599245_2354605"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A memory-optimized database engine integrated into the SQL Server engine, optimized for OLTP workloads accessing memory resident data to achieve significant improvements in performance and reduction in processing time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2599245">XTP engine</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2354605">OLTP memorian</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40516_2353946_2354606"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The diagnostic tool that helps troubleshoot Kerberos-related connectivity issues with SQL Server, SQL Server Reporting Services, and SQL Server Analysis Services.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353946">Microsoft Kerberos Configuration Manager</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2354606">Microsoft Kerberos Configuration Manager</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40517_2353947_2354608"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The ability to run both analytics and OLTP workloads on the same database tables at the same time and eliminate the need for ETL and a data warehouse.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353947">real-time operational analytics</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2354608">denbora errealeko analisia</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40517_2520278_2354608"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The ability to run both analytics and OLTP workloads on the same database tables at the same time and eliminate the need for ETL and a data warehouse.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2520278">operational analytics</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2354608">denbora errealeko analisia</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40518_2353948_2354603"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The optional feature of the SQL Server Database Engine to execute scripts written in a supported language, such as R, from Transact-SQL.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353948">Advanced Analytics Extensions</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2354603">Analisi-luzapen aurreratuak</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40519_2353949_2354610"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A satellite service in the BxLserver.exe process that starts the R runtime engine.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353949">SQL Server Launchpad</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2354610">SQL Server Launchpad</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40520_2353950_2354611"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An integrated set of easy-to-use graphical management tools for accessing, configuring, managing, administering, and developing all components of SQL Server.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353950">SQL Server Management Tools</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2354611">SQL Server Management Tools</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40521_2353984_2354326"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A free feature that allows setting up online business meetings using work email. The feature is part of Skype for Business experience and has multiple online entry-points (e.g. Skype.com).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353984">Skype Meetings</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2354326">Skype bilerak</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4053_11478_439230"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A keyboard key that is used in conjunction with another key to produce some special feature or function and is typically marked with the letters Alt.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="11478">ALT key</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="439230">ALT tekla</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40537_2354519_2356634"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The phone app that helps customers transfer content from their Android phone to their Windows 10 Mobile phone. There are 2 instances of the app, one that you install on Android, and one that you install on Windows (phone only).​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2354519">Move to Windows</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2356634">Eraman Windows-era</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40541_2354632_2686438"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A statistical measure of the reliability of an estimate, which calculates the margin of error.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2354632">confidence</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2686438">ziurtasun</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4055_21561_439292"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The smallest unit of information handled by a computer or device. One bit expresses a 1 or a 0 in a binary numeral, or a true or false logical condition. A group of 8 bits makes up a byte, which can represent many types of information, such as a letter of the alphabet, a decimal digit, or other character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="21561">bit</term><termNote t