sparently and securely to the Microsoft Azure cloud, freeing up space, reducing cost and maintenance, without impacting your existing operations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493748">Stretch</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2499444">Stretch</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44354_2493748_2499445"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows you to migrate your cold data transparently and securely to the Microsoft Azure cloud, freeing up space, reducing cost and maintenance, without impacting your existing operations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493748">Stretch</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2499445">Stretch Database</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44354_2493752_2499444"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows you to migrate your cold data transparently and securely to the Microsoft Azure cloud, freeing up space, reducing cost and maintenance, without impacting your existing operations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493752">Stretch Database</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2499444">Stretch</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44354_2493752_2499445"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows you to migrate your cold data transparently and securely to the Microsoft Azure cloud, freeing up space, reducing cost and maintenance, without impacting your existing operations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493752">Stretch Database</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2499445">Stretch Database</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44355_2493977_2511390"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A container for a collection of configuration settings file with extension .ppkg. Provisioning packages are simple enough that with a short set of written instructions, a student or non-technical employee can use them to configure their device.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493977">provisioning package</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2511390">hornikuntza-pakete</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><te