d threads, for the processor to keep it as busy as possible and coordinates multiple processors to optimize performance. The kernel also synchronizes activities among Executive-level subcomponents, such as I/O Manager and Process Manager, and handles hardware exceptions and other hardware-dependent functions. The kernel works closely with the hardware abstraction layer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="72367">kernel</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="439660">nukleo</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44631_2512676_2518300"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The offer for the month-to-month subscription of Office 365 Business.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2512676">Office 365 Business (Month to Month)</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2518300">Office 365 Business (hilabeteka)</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44632_2512677_2518303"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The offer for the month-to-month subscription of Microsoft 365 Business Standard.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2512677">Office 365 Business Premium (Month to Month)</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="gra