l</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45619_2572051_2574867"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A subscription that is paid upfront and that automatically renews at the end of the term.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2572051">pre-paid subscription</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2574867">aurrez ordaindutako harpidetza</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45621_2572053_2574918"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A business that sells goods to the public in small quantities for use or consumption rather than for resale.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2572053">retailer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2574918">saltzaile</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45634_2572083_2576063"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Xbox One support app that allows users to optimize their Xbox experience, stay informed about issues, get personalized help and take actions to solve issues or improve their overall experience.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2572083">Xbox Assist</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2576063">Xbox laguntza teknikoa</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4565_31042_1768200"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of finalizing a purchase on a website. For example, when customers shop on your website, they may select several items and save them in their shopping basket. When they have finished shopping, they click on a checkout link or graphical button that takes them to an online form where they enter their name, billing address, payment type, and shipping information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="31042">checkout</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1768200">erosketa amaitze</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45654_2572168_2576061"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The effect that users can apply to a photo or video clip in the Photos app. It resembles a waterfall.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2572168">Waterfall</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2576061">Ur-jauzia</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><te