 use to manipulate a window or close a program. You click the program icon at the left of the title bar to open this menu. The context menu of a window replaces this menu.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="118880">control menu</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="439943">kontrol-menu</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45663_2572287_2574943"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A possible danger of an attack that takes advantage of computer security holes for which the creation of a patch would take at least a day.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2572287">zero-day threat</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2574943">egun batean konpon daitekeen mehatxu</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45666_2572288_2574820"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An agent that collects data from an endpoint.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2572288">end-point agent</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2574820">amaiera-puntuko agente</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeec