e calls from) mobile phones and landlines and send and receive SMS messages.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2573934">Phone Plan</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2575370">Telefono-zerbitzua</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45685_2573938_2575371"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service that enables Skype users to make calls from Skype to mobile phones or landlines, paid for by purchasing credits or a monthly subscription.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2573938">Skype to Phone</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2575371">Skype-tik telefonora</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45689_2575485_2578223"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office feature that allows users to translate words, segments or full texts and that is powered exclusively by the cloud-based Microsoft Translator service.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2575485">Translator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2578223">Itzultzailea</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</t