ar</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2625309">SQL Server Express</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45725_2577624_2625309"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The free edition of SQL Server ideal for development and production for desktop, web, and small server applications.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2577624">Microsoft SQL Server Express</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2625309">SQL Server Express</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45737_2578905_2815800"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The web service that helps you search for addresses, places, business listings by name or category, and other geographic information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2578905">Search service</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2815800">Search Service</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45789_2579453_2582060"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The extension for Cortana that connects users to custom services and solutions. Skills can be invoked on Cortana to perform certain actions, such as checking the user’s bank balance, reading a bed time story, or booking a cab with Uber.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2579453">Cortana skill</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2582060">Cortana gaitasuna</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45790_2579456_2582064"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A collection of policy settings that control updates for devices that use Windows 10. With these settings, information technology administrators decide when and which devices receive updates in their organization, and set different schedules for groups of devices. They can also pause updates for individual devices.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2579456">Windows Update for Business</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2582064">Enpresetarako Windows Update</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45792_2579483_2814243"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A segment for which both static and dynamic profiles are combined.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id=