 on the Power Apps platform.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816032">Power Apps Checker</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2840806">Power Apps egiaztatzaile</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49794_2816264_2818983"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To factor a number means to break it up into numbers that can be multiplied together to get the original number. EXAMPLES: 6 = 3 x 2 so, factors of 6 are 3 and 2; 9 = 3 x 3 so, factors of 9 are 3 and 3.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816264">factor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2818983">faktorizatu</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49795_2816502_2819002"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office 365 offering for large nonprofits that includes email, Office desktop applications, cloud file-storage and sharing, web conferencing with IM, audio, HD video, and meeting broadcasts over the Internet to up to 10,000 people, a corporate social network, work-management tools, compliance solutions, data protection with DLP, advanced eDiscovery tools, analytics, advanced security, and other services.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816502">Office 365 Nonprofit E5<