 in points earned to improve your score. This can be a direct action like changing a setting, or an indirect action like providing training to users that encourages them to use a feature more.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2819449">recommendation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2822319">gomendio</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49869_2819450_2822295"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Status of a Microsoft Managed Desktop device if it meets all of these criteria: synced with Intune in the last 5 days AND at least 6 hours powered on and connected to Internet AND at least 2 hours continuously powered on and connected to Internet.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2819450">active</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2822295">aktibo</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49870_2819451_2822298"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A minimum or starting point used for comparisons.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2819451">baseline</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2822298">oinarri</term><