k</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2859540">gonbidatuaren sarbide-esteka</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50474_2857356_2859557"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of sharing link that allows recipients to access the file or folder without authenticating.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2857356">guest access link</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2859557">partekatzeko esteka</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50475_2857362_2859532"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The shared sense of belonging that builds cohesion within a defined team, helping teammates to work as one.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2857362">collective identity</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2859532">talde-nortasun</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50476_2857364_2859560"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The ability to take into account not just yourself and your teammates, but also the context that surrounds you.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2857364">situational awareness</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2859560">egoeraren araberako kontzientzia</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50477_2857366_2859530"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The ability to sense the emotions of others and recognize the impact that one’s actions may have on others.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2857366">co-awareness</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2859530">bata bestearekiko kontzientzia</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50478_2857368_2859536"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The productive force that emerges when a team harnesses their differences, as a result of nurturing and balancing the other key team dynamics: team purpose, collective identity, awareness, inclusion, trust and vulnerability.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2857368">constructive tension</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2859536">tentsio konstruktibo</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50479_2857369_2859528"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The joint understanding of self and others that enables teams to navigate interpersonal dynamics and foster team cohesion.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2857369">awareness and inclusion</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2859528">kontzientzia eta inklusio</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50480_2857376_2859526"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">UI label for inserting an Anyone link.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2857376">Anyone</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2859526">Edozein erabiltzaile</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50481_2857401_2859547"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Partner web app or add-in that integrates with Microsoft Graph and Microsoft productivity apps, workflows, and data across 