lows users to place a 3D object of a specific size into the AR environment around them.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2861024">AR Cube</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862244">AR kubo</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50525_2861025_2862246"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Combining nearby pins together to form one new cluster pin, usually with a number of pins provided, to indicate the density of locations for a certain zoom level on the map.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2861025">pin clustering</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862246">txintxeta-multzokatze</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50526_2861026_2862245"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The pins combined together on the map to form one new cluster pin, instead of showing a bunch of individual pins on top of each other, to indicate the density of locations for a certain zoom level.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2861026">cluster pin</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862245">multzo-txintxeta</term