 a hash value with 64 hexadecimal characters, or the hash value itself.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862043">SHA-256</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862858">SHA-256</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50543_2862396_2863093"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The personalized information stream feature of Microsoft Launcher that includes news, events from the user's calendar, photos, notes, contacts, recently-launched apps, and more.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862396">feed</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2863093">jario</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50544_2862397_2863103"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Microsoft Launcher page consisting of a card that has been pinned to the Home screen providing a full-screen experience to card users with all filters and sorting preserved as of the moment the page was pinned.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862397">pinned page</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2863103">ainguratutako orri</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP