ally) acquire/obtain capabilities from certified Carriers, all through the Teams Admin Center.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2926577">Operator Connect</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2928432">Operadore bidezko konexioa</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51983_2926579_2928424"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The tab in Microsoft Teams that allows the user to create, manage, and share approval requests such as stakeholder authorizations, customer signatures, or manager acknowledgements.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2926579">Approvals</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2928424">Onarpenak</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51984_2926583_2928426"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Teams, the way to present in which only the shared content itself is shown.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2926583">Content only</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2928426">Edukia soilik</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Proper