lity of Sales Accelerator Lead Management that improves the seller productivity with better quality leads. Some of the functionality includes: duplicate detection, avoid routing duplicates to the same seller, as well as enable automated action upon detection.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3024531">Lead Hygiene</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3025210">Bezerogai-garbiketa</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53152_3024532_3025211"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature in Dynamics 365 Finance that allows finance managers to set up, manage billing schedules, invoice, recognize revenue, and renew contracts of recurring subscriptions. Subscription Billing makes compliance with ASC 606 and IFRS 15 easier with streamlined recurring revenue management tools.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3024532">subscription billing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3025211">harpidetza-fakturazio</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53154_3024608_3025262"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An item of original video programming, such as the video content created by Microsoft technical experts for docs.microsoft.com.</descrip></desc