A design element that lets you establish a block of common content that you can reuse in multiple emails, forms, and/or pages. It is used to establish common headers, footers and other blocks of content that you would like to standardize across your communications.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3063049">content block</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3063117">eduki-bloke</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53832_3063050_3063119"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A primary model in Dynamics 365 Marketing, which includes trigger-based customer journeys, custom triggers, and SMS and push notifications. It allows you to trigger customer journeys in real time based on the signals and rich profile data you collect from your customers, pick the right channel for each individual, and connect in the moments that matter.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3063050">real-time marketing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3063119">denbora errealeko marketin</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53833_3063051_3063118"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A primary model in Dynamics 365 Marketing, which provides email marketing, customer journeys, lead scoring, marketing