 features that enables premium capabilities for additional meeting scenarios, including Virtual appointments and webinars.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3093359">Microsoft Teams Premium</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3093713">Microsoft Teams Premium</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54253_3093359_3093715"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The paid Microsoft Teams offer with additional features that enables premium capabilities for additional meeting scenarios, including Virtual appointments and webinars.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3093359">Microsoft Teams Premium</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3093715">Teams Premium</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54253_3093360_3093713"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The paid Microsoft Teams offer with additional features that enables premium capabilities for additional meeting scenarios, including Virtual appointments and webinars.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3093360">Teams Premium</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet x