of detail or specify the layout by dragging fields and items or by showing and hiding items in the drop-down lists for the fields.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="360134">PivotChart view</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="441097">PivotChart ikuspegi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6540_8001_439205"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Interactive or animated content used on the Internet. Active content includes ActiveX controls and web browser add-ons.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="8001">active content</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="439205">eduki aktibo</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6563_123499_439975"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A data structure containing zero or more nodes that are linked together in a hierarchy. If any nodes are present, one node is the root; each node except the root is the child of one and only one other node, and each node has zero or more nodes as children.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="123499">tree</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="eu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="4399